{"answer":"Multiple source entity matches; specify a source key.","candidates":[{"aliases":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:2497","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","text":"solo"},{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:2497","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","text":"solo"}],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:2497","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"},{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:2497","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:2497","original":"An image containing a single person. No one else should be visible in the image.\r\n\r\nThat means only one copy of the character. These situations should not be tagged solo:\r\n\r\n* Single characters being depicted from [[multiple views]].\r\n* Multiple instances of the same character, as in [[dual persona]], [[clone]], [[selfcest]], or [[time paradox]] situations.\r\n\r\nThese situations should be tagged [[solo focus]], not solo:\r\n\r\n* Pictures focusing on one character among a crowd of nondescript, less detailed [[people]].\r\n* Single characters engaged in [[tag group:sex acts|sex acts]] with [[faceless]], [[out of frame]], or [[POV]] characters.\r\n\r\nOnly physically present people or person-like characters count against a character being solo. Situations that can be solo include:\r\n\r\n* A single character with inanimate [[doll]]s, [[figure]]s, [[painting (object)|]]s, [[poster (object)|]]s, or [[photo (object)|]]s of other characters.\r\n* A single character with minor pet, [[familiar]], [[mascot]], or object characters.\r\n\r\nh4. Examples\r\n\r\n* !post #7251942: [[Solo]] + [[1boy]]\r\n* !post #135361: [[Solo]] + [[1girl]]\r\n* !post #8691735: [[Solo]] + [[1other]]\r\n\r\nh4. Non-examples\r\n\r\n* !post #5870555: [[Solo focus]]\r\n* !post #9832301: [[Solo focus]]\r\n* !post #7465226: [[Multiple views]] \r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[1boy]]\r\n* [[1girl]]\r\n* [[1other]]\r\n* [[solo focus]]\r\n* [[Tag group:Character count]]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"solo"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"6965"},"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:2497","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:2497","locator":null,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","type":"page"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"alias","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:2497","original":"An image containing a single person. No one else should be visible in the image.\r\n\r\nThat means only one copy of the character. These situations should not be tagged solo:\r\n\r\n* Single characters being depicted from [[multiple views]].\r\n* Multiple instances of the same character, as in [[dual persona]], [[clone]], [[selfcest]], or [[time paradox]] situations.\r\n\r\nThese situations should be tagged [[solo focus]], not solo:\r\n\r\n* Pictures focusing on one character among a crowd of nondescript, less detailed [[people]].\r\n* Single characters engaged in [[tag group:sex acts|sex acts]] with [[faceless]], [[out of frame]], or [[POV]] characters.\r\n\r\nOnly physically present people or person-like characters count against a character being solo. Situations that can be solo include:\r\n\r\n* A single character with inanimate [[doll]]s, [[figure]]s, [[painting (object)|]]s, [[poster (object)|]]s, or [[photo (object)|]]s of other characters.\r\n* A single character with minor pet, [[familiar]], [[mascot]], or object characters.\r\n\r\nh4. Examples\r\n\r\n* !post #7251942: [[Solo]] + [[1boy]]\r\n* !post #135361: [[Solo]] + [[1girl]]\r\n* !post #8691735: [[Solo]] + [[1other]]\r\n\r\nh4. Non-examples\r\n\r\n* !post #5870555: [[Solo focus]]\r\n* !post #9832301: [[Solo focus]]\r\n* !post #7465226: [[Multiple views]] \r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[1boy]]\r\n* [[1girl]]\r\n* [[1other]]\r\n* [[solo focus]]\r\n* [[Tag group:Character count]]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"solo"}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"tag_wiki-complete-a2eb055c578d:a2eb055c578d37e82b71df787cd11b7616e77768eb319cf0839831cfdbb28fef:line:136755","source_id":"tag_wiki-complete-a2eb055c578d"}],"descriptions":[],"entry_key":{"kind":"tag","namespace":"local.tag_aggregate","value":"solo"},"evidence_id":"tag_wiki-complete-a2eb055c578d:a2eb055c578d37e82b71df787cd11b7616e77768eb319cf0839831cfdbb28fef:line:136755","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"tag_wiki-complete-a2eb055c578d:a2eb055c578d37e82b71df787cd11b7616e77768eb319cf0839831cfdbb28fef:line:136755","locator":null,"source_id":"tag_wiki-complete-a2eb055c578d","status":"source_backed","type":"tag"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"exact","matched_documents":[],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"tag_wiki-complete-a2eb055c578d"}],"canonical":null,"citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[],"entry_key":null,"input_quer